/p></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:136; left:380; width:339; height:350;"><div class="s1"><p class="s86"><span class="s73">Эндогенные</span></p><p class="s77"><span class="s76">Продукты</span><span class="s76"> </span><span class="s76">жизнедеятельности</span><span class="s87"> </span><span class="s76">макроорганизмов</span><span class="s76">:</span><span class="s76"> п</span><span class="s76">ровосп</span><span class="s76">.</span><span class="s76"> цитокины</span><span class="s76"> </span><span class="s88">(ИЛ-1,</span><span class="s88"> </span><span class="s88">ИЛ-6,</span><span class="s76"> </span><span class="s76">ФНОα).</span></p><p class="s89"> </p><p class="s89"><span class="s90"> </span><span class="s80">Физико-химические</span><span class="s80"> </span><span class="s80">свойства:</span></p><p class="s81"><span class="s82">-</span><span class="s83">пептиды;</span></p><p class="s81"><span class="s82">-</span><span class="s83">термолабильны;</span></p><p class="s81"><span class="s82">-</span><span class="s83">не </span><span class="s83">формируется</span><span class="s83"> </span><span class="s83">толерантность;</span></p><p class="s91"><span class="s92">-</span><span class="s93">нет </span><span class="s83">видовой</span><span class="s93"> </span><span class="s83">специфичности;</span></p><p class="s91"><span class="s92">-</span><span class="s83">мишень </span><span class="s84">– </span><span class="s83">нейроны </span><span class="s83">центра</span><span class="s93"> </span><span class="s84">терморегуляции.</span></p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://D76182D5-C28A-472B-9C60-AB50AE863396/x-apple-ql-magic/AE8CA1E1-DE6A-4C09-9D59-EBB1E2CEF59E.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:79; left:186; width:108; height:75;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://1FE11170-F612-4826-9545-DED093BA8F30/x-apple-ql-magic/A83429CB-DD5F-4BE7-9613-2E3BDD463EBC.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:78; left:419; width:131; height:71;"></div><div class="slide" style="top:0; left