</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://53ECAB2D-4863-48BD-A51B-1B4B4F9BEB45/x-apple-ql-magic/2501045C-E40A-43BB-B5D7-3158E99E50D2.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-20; width:761; height:68;"><div style="position:absolute; top:44; left:252; width:216; height:33;"><div class="s62"><p class="s63"><span class="s94">Стадии</span><span class="s95"> </span><span class="s96">лихорадки</span></p></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:127; left:48; width:646; height:184;"><div class="s62"><p class="s64"><span class="s97">•</span><span class="s59">I</span><span class="s59"> — повышения температуры (</span><span class="s59">st</span><span class="s59">. </span><span class="s59">incrementi</span><span class="s59">);</span></p><p class="s66"><span class="s97">•</span><span class="s59">II </span><span class="s59">— стояния повышенной температуры (</span><span class="s59">st</span><span class="s59">. </span><span class="s59">fastigii</span><span class="s59">);</span></p><p class="s66"><span class="s97">•</span><span class="s59">III </span><span class="s59">— снижения температуры (</span><span class="s59">st</span><span class="s59">. </span><span class="s59">decrementi</span><span class="s59">).</span></p><p class="s66"> </p></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
